      "writtenOn": "2024-11-21T21:46:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These matches the coefficients in https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/medfound/recommended-8-bit-yuv-formats-for-video-rendering#converting-8-bit-yuv-to-rgb888\n\nSee also https://g-issues.webmproject.org/issues/375011696.\n\nIn the next three comments, all divisions are real (floating-point) divisions. 0.299 is K_R and 0.114 is K_B of BT.601.",
      "revId": "b1f544a4d5d682717e564d585e24624a24c0d8be",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
