      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-21T21:46:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The exact value of the first coefficient (1.164) is 255 / 219.\n\nThe exact value of the second coefficient (-0.813) is 255 / 224 * -2 * 0.299 * (1 − 0.299) / (1 − 0.299 − 0.114).\n\nThe exact value of the third coefficient (-0.392) is 255 / 224 * -2 * 0.114 * (1 − 0.114) / (1 − 0.299 − 0.114).",
      "revId": "b1f544a4d5d682717e564d585e24624a24c0d8be",
